# Build output (cargo, cargo xtask installer).
/target
/pms-pimpbox/target

# Raw PGO training output; only the merged pgo/pms.profdata and pms-pimpbox/pgo/pimpbox.profdata are kept.
*.profraw

# What PimpMyShell and its tools leave beside things: logs, the settings window's first backup of a hand-written config.
*.log
*.toml.bak

# The release key's secret half never goes in the repository (pms-release keygen won't write it in one anyway).
*.key
*signing-key*

# A user's own files, in a public repository: a config, its whole-file backup from before layering, one a save left
# behind, and a report. (pms.example.toml and pms/shipped/*.toml are ours, and don't match.)
/pms.toml
*.toml.full.bak
*.toml.tmp
pms-report.txt

# Crash dumps hold what was in memory, and this one injects into Explorer.
*.dmp

# Keys in other clothes.
*.pem
*.pfx

# Editors and Windows.
.vs/
.vscode/
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
